Main_Char: (wait...is that...?)
Main_Char: Charlotte!! You're alright! I'm awake now!
sibling (idle): ...?
sibling (happy): You're awake!!! I was so worried!
sibling (thinking): After the crash I had no idea what happened to you but these kind people saved us!
Main_Char: I guess we got lucky, are there any other survivors?
sibling (thinking): Yeah theres one, but I'm not sure where they are right now.
sibling (happy): But that's not important right now, you should come help me some work!
Main_Char: Work?
sibling (happy): Yeah! I've been helping the townsfolk with some stuff around the village, they saved us after all, it's the least I can do!
Main_Char: So you think I should help them as well?
sibling (happy): That'd be great!
Main_Char: (hmm so I could either help, or not help....)
- help them...
